# Blog Management System

## Project Overview
This project is a simple Blog Management System developed using PHP and MySQL. The system allows users to register, login, add blog posts, edit posts, delete posts, and search content.


# Task 1 – Development Setup

## Objective
Setup PHP development environment using XAMPP and VS Code.

## Tools Used
- XAMPP
- PHP
- MySQL
- VS Code

## Work Done
- Installed XAMPP
- Started Apache and MySQL
- Created project folder in htdocs
- Connected project with localhost

## Files
- index.php
- db.php
